  "continuous_observations": [
    "Complete uncaptioned duel12 reads face-off, lunge/parry, cloth cost, lateral displacement/collapse, grasp/landing, descending counter, tight bind, low-source kick, wall pin and exhausted pause. Face acting and silhouette separation stay strong through camera changes; final calm surfaces allow the story to carry attention.",
    "D02 intersects bronze lance head rather than the intended shaft. D03 torn cloth is visible but actual tip contact remains uncertain. D04 already contains left-hand wall brace; D05 reads painful collapse more clearly than fresh shoulder collision, and its F1 removes some continuing-force spray.",
    "D06 Ilyra occupies the raised destination with lance lifted; D07 puts her back below and shows three cyan marks rather than one clear paired seam. D08 drops both actors to lower floor without a descent. The gravity source/control and transit cost cannot be reconstructed reliably from actual pixels.",
    "D09, D11 and D12 place the saber in the injured LEFT hand, interrupted by right ownership at D10. Forearm injury becomes upper-arm tatters/clean forearm before the blood returns at D12. D10\u2013D11 add unexplained adults that vanish at D12.",
    "D11 local into-pier alignment and direct pressure are visibly successful. The still image reads sustained pin or culmination of drive; it does not independently prove an impulsive shoulder strike. This preserves the reviewer/root nuance without turning either interpretation into a full mechanics pass.",
    "Final complete squad and war reread reproduces earlier full-sequence findings: squad passage remains contested, and war column remains on the ice. Neither completed escape nor completed evacuation is established."
  ],
